# The Expo app. It is built by EAS, not Vercel, and the website never imports
# from it (the app imports from the website, not the other way round).
#
# Anchored with the leading slash: a bare `mobile/` matches a directory of that
# name at any depth, which took src/app/api/mobile/ — the app's whole API —
# out of every deployment.
/mobile/
